+/* --- Head to Head (relay request 16; Jonna, Nov 25, 2026) ------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Two players, the same 10 Hard Mixed questions, highest score wins (a tie goes to whoever spent less time answering).
+ * Nobody waits for the other: the one who starts plays first, then the other plays the same questions when they're ready.
+ * Two ways to start, the player's choice:
+ *   Challenge Someone      pick a player by name. Once you've played, it's theirs to play (or decline) for 48 hours.
+ *   Find Me an Opponent    if someone else's open game is waiting, you play its questions against their score; if not,
+ *                          you play first and the next person who asks gets your game. An open game waits 7 days.
+ * No computer opponent. Head to Head games never count for the monthly leaderboard. Nothing is emailed or pushed: the
+ * app shows Your Turn when it next asks. Kept in trivia/h2h.json, by game id:
+ *   { a, aName, b, bName, mode: 'pick'|'open', ids: [question ids], made, sent, exp, aScore, bScore, status }
+ *   status: 'first' (the starter is playing), 'theirs' (waiting for b), 'open' (waiting for anyone), 'done', 'declined',
+ *   'expired'. A score is { total, right, ms, at }.
+ * The app reviewers' account plays only against reviewAccount.contacts (MISMO staff) and is never offered to anyone else. */
